cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this model, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "korean-handwriting-rec: Korean handwriting OCR model fine-tuned from PP-OCRv5"
abstract: >-
  Korean handwriting OCR recognition model. The PP-OCRv5 Korean recognition
  model (korean_PP-OCRv5_mobile_rec) fine-tuned on 4.6M Korean word images of
  handwriting and printed government forms from AI Hub. Word accuracy on
  held-out handwritten words rises from 67.2% to 97.4%.
authors:
